e loading (PubMed:10605026, PubMed:9427624). Interacts with PSMB5 and PSMB8 (PubMed:15488952)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with Epstein-Barr virus BNLF2a"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with herpes simplex virus US12/ICP47"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with adenovirus E3-19K glycoprotein, which binds TAP1-TAP2 and acts as a TAPBP inhibitor, preventing TAP1-TAP2 association with MHCI"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q03518-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":808,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000383235.4","ENST00000414467.2","ENST00000418205.2","ENST00000424897.2","ENST00000439781.2","ENST00000440894.2"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,1],[62,2,747]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":1,"original":"M","replacement":"MAELLASAGSACSWDFPRAPPSFPPPAASRGGLGGTRSFR","added":61}],"missing":0,"replaced":0,"novel":60,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q03518-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q03518-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":76.3,"plddt":[[0,79],[50,38],[70,2],[50,2],[70,2],[50,1],[70,7],[50,1],[70,2],[50,6],[0,9],[50,29],[0,13],[50,28],[0,10],[50,3],[70,8],[50,1],[70,7],[90,1],[70,2],[90,2],[70,3],[90,1],[70,6],[90,2],[70,1],[90,2],[70,20],[90,2],[70,1],[90,21],[70,9],[90,1],[70,2],[90,2],[70,42],[90,1],[70,41],[90,1],[70,1],[90,58],[70,2],[90,1],[70,35],[90,2],[70,38],[50,1],[70,12],[90,10],[70,8],[90,11],[70,1],[90,7],[70,4],[90,11],[70,3],[90,1],[70,1],[90,11],[70,1],[90,3],[70,2],[90,10],[70,6],[90,10],[70,5],[90,11],[70,3],[90,2],[70,1],[90,5],[70,1],[90,6],[70,12],[90,20],[70,26],[90,6],[70,7],[90,10],[70,2],[90,14],[70,1],[90,1],[70,1],[90,2],[70,5],[50,2],[0,4]],"losingConfidence":0}}],"ensemblGenes":["ENSG00000168394.14","ENSG00000206297.7","ENSG00000224212.4","ENSG00000226173.4","ENSG00000227816.4","ENSG00000230705.4","ENSG00000232367.5"],"un